@startuml
' C 端正式详情 — P-001-03 §7.5 / TECH §5.1 public detail

title C 端正式详情（运行状态 + 模块投影）

actor User
participant "Client" as C
participant "Public API" as API
participant "ContentApplication" as App
participant "读模型 (Repository)" as Repo

User -> C: 打开内容页
C -> API: GET /api-content/public/api/v1/contents/{uuid}
API -> App: getPublishedDetail(uuid)
App -> Repo: 查询聚合（基本信息+展示配置+未删模块）
Repo --> App: Content 投影

alt status != PUBLISHED
  App --> API: 404 ContentNotFound（E-R-004）
  API --> C: 统一下线页
else status == PUBLISHED
  App -> App: runtimeStatus = \nnow<startAt ? SCHEDULED :\nnow<=endAt ? RUNNING : EXPIRED
  App --> API: 200 详情（三区投影 + runtimeStatus + summary）
  API --> C: 渲染内容页
end

note right of App
  模块按 sortOrder 升序投影；
  载荷仅透传 URL 类字段，
  不做富文本再加工
end note

@enduml
